{'symbol': 'SYY', 'date': '2021-09-02 16:30:00', 'title': 'SYSCO DONATES $50,000 TO AMERICAN RED CROSS FOR HURRICANE IDA RELIEF', 'text': 'HOUSTON, SEPT. 02, 2021 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- SYSCO CORPORATION (NYSE: SYY), THE LEADING GLOBAL FOODSERVICE DISTRIBUTION COMPANY, ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT THE COMPANY WILL DONATE $50,000 TO THE AMERICAN RED CROSS FOR RELIEF EFFORTS FOLLOWING HURRICANE IDA. THESE FUNDS, ALONG WITH OTHER DONATIONS OF FOOD AND WATER, WILL BE USED TO PROVIDE ADDED SUPPORT TO THE COMMUNITIES AND INDIVIDUALS IN NEED.'}